 <h5 class="card-title fw-bold">SIÊU ANH HÙNG TRỞ LẠI</h5>
 <p class="card-text text-muted mb-4">2D Lồng Tiếng</p>
 
 <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2">
 <span class="text-muted">Rạp:</span>
 <strong>Ticket Box - Quận 1</strong>
 </div>
 <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2">
 <span class="text-muted">Suất chiếu:</span>
 <strong>19:30 | Hôm nay</strong>
 </div>
